// English movie subtitles for Age of the Ring 10 - labels used by data/english/movies/*.ini

SUBTITLE:ENOverallGameIntro_01
"The Shadow is almost upon us, Aragorn."
END

SUBTITLE:ENOverallGameIntro_02
"Soon I must come unto all that I strove for, or I will fall into darkness."
END

SUBTITLE:ENOverallGameIntro_03
"You shall not pass!"
END

SUBTITLE:ENOverallGameIntro_04
"And this world will come to ruin."
END

SUBTITLE:ENOverallGameIntro_05
"Long have you carried with you the remnants of the past."
END

SUBTITLE:ENOverallGameIntro_06
"This is your test."
END

SUBTITLE:ENOverallGameIntro_07
"Every path you have trod, through wilderness, through war,"
END

SUBTITLE:ENOverallGameIntro_08
"has led to this road."
END

SUBTITLE:ENOverallGameIntro_09
"We come to it at last."
END

SUBTITLE:ENOverallGameIntro_10
"The great battle of our time."
END

SUBTITLE:ENOverallGameIntro_11
"The blade that was broken shall return to Minas Tirith."
END

SUBTITLE:ENOverallGameIntro_12
"Put aside the Ranger."
END

SUBTITLE:ENOverallGameIntro_13
"Become who you were born to be."
END

SUBTITLE:ENOverallGameIntro_14
"No! Let him go, you filth!"
END

SUBTITLE:ENOverallGameIntro_15
"We fight."
END

SUBTITLE:ENOverallGameIntro_16
"I see in your eyes the same fear that would take the heart of me."
END

SUBTITLE:ENOverallGameIntro_17
"A day may come when the courage of Men fails,"
END

SUBTITLE:ENOverallGameIntro_18
"when we forsake our friends and break all bonds of fellowship."
END

SUBTITLE:ENOverallGameIntro_19
"But it is not this day!"
END

SUBTITLE:ENOverallGameIntro_20
"Whatever happens, stay with me."
END

SUBTITLE:ENOverallGameIntro_21
"This day we fight!"
END

SUBTITLE:ENOverallGameIntro_22
"All we have to decide here is what to do with the time that is given to us."
END

SUBTITLE:ENOverallGameIntro_23
"Hold back! Hold back to the mountain!"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign00_01
"It began with the forging of the Great Rings."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign00_02
"Three were given to the Elves,"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign00_03
"immortal, wisest and fairest of all beings."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign00_04
"Seven to the Dwarf-lords,"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign00_05
"great miners and craftsmen of the mountain halls."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign00_06
"And nine, nine rings were gifted to the race of Men,"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign00_07
"who, above all else, desire power."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign00_08
"For within these rings was bound the strength and will to govern each race."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign00_09
"But they were all of them deceived,"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign00_10
"for another ring was made."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign00_11
"In the land of Mordor, in the fires of Mount Doom,"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign00_12
"the Dark Lord Sauron forged in secret a master ring to control all others."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign00_13
"And into this Ring he poured his cruelty, his malice"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign00_14
"and his will to dominate all life."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign00_15
"One Ring to rule them all."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign00_16
"One by one,"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign00_17
"the free lands of Middle-earth fell to the power of the Ring."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign00_18
"But there were some who resisted."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign01_01
"Sauron, the enemy of the Free Peoples of Middle-earth, was defeated."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign01_02
"But the hearts of Men are easily corrupted,"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign01_03
"and the Ring of Power has a will of its own."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign01_04
"History became legend. Legend became myth."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign01_05
"And for two and a half thousand years, the Ring passed out of all knowledge,"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign01_06
"until, when chance came,"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign01_07
"it ensnared a new bearer."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign01_08
"My precious."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign01_09
"The Ring came to the creature Gollum,"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign01_10
"who took it deep into the tunnels of the Misty Mountains."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign01_11
"But something happened then the Ring did not intend."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign01_12
"On the 22nd day of September in the year 1400,"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign01_13
"by Shire Reckoning."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign01_14
"Bag End, Bagshot Row, Hobbiton, Westfarthing,"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign01_15
"the Shire,"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign01_16
"Middle-earth,"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign01_17
"the Third Age of this world."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign01a_01
"Concerning Hobbits."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign01a_02
"Hobbits have been living and farming in the Four Farthings of the Shire"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign01a_03
"for many hundreds of years,"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign01a_04
"quite content to ignore and be ignored by the world of the Big Folk."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign01a_05
"In fact, it has been remarked by some"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign01a_06
"that Hobbits' only real passion is for food."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign01a_07
"A rather unfair observation,"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign01a_08
"as we have also developed a keen interest"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign01a_09
"in the brewing of ales and the smoking of pipe-weed."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign01a_10
"But where our hearts truly lie"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign01a_11
"is in peace and quiet and good tilled earth."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign01a_12
"For all Hobbits share a love for things that grow."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign01a_13
"And yes, no doubt to others our ways seem quaint."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign01a_14
"But today of all days, it is brought home to me"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign01a_15
"it is no bad thing to celebrate a simple life."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign01b_01
"Gandalf, my old friend, this will be a night to remember."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign01b_02
"Today is my one hundred and eleventh birthday!"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign01b_03
"Alas, eleventy-one years is far too short a time"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign01b_04
"to live among such excellent and admirable Hobbits."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign01b_05
"I don't know half of you half as well as I should like,"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign01b_06
"and I like less than half of you half as well as you deserve."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign01b_07
"I regret to announce this is the end."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign01b_08
"I'm going now."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign01b_09
"I bid you all a very fond farewell."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign01b_10
"Goodbye."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign02_01
"Bilbo! Bilbo!"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign02_02
"My precious."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign02_03
"This is the One Ring, forged by the Dark Lord Sauron"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign02_04
"in the fires of Mount Doom,"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign02_05
"taken by Isildur from the hand of Sauron himself."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign02_06
"Bilbo found it. In Gollum's cave."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign02_07
"Yes. For sixty years the Ring lay quiet in Bilbo's keeping,"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign02_08
"prolonging his life, delaying old age."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign02_09
"But no longer, Frodo. Evil is stirring in Mordor."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign02_10
"The Ring has awoken. It's heard its master's call."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign02_11
"But he was destroyed. Sauron was destroyed."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign02_12
"The spirit of Sauron endured."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign02_13
"Frodo, he must never find it."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign02_14
"What must I do?"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign07_01
"- Where are you taking us? - Into the Wild."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign07_02
"How do we know this Strider is a friend of Gandalf?"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign07_03
"I think a servant of the Enemy would look fairer and feel fouler."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign07_04
"He's foul enough."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign07_05
"We have no choice but to trust him."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign07_06
"But where is he leading us?"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign07_07
"To Rivendell, Master Gamgee."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign07_08
"To the house of Elrond."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign07_09
"Did you hear that? Rivendell! We're going to see the Elves!"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign03a_01
"Where am I?"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign03a_02
"You are in the house of Elrond."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign03a_03
"And it is ten o'clock in the morning"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign03a_04
"on October the 24th, if you want to know."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign03a_05
"- Gandalf! - Yes, I'm here."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign03a_06
"And you're lucky to be here, too."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign03a_07
"A few more hours and you would have been beyond our aid."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign03a_08
"What happened, Gandalf?"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign03a_09
"Why didn't you meet us?"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign03a_10
"Oh, I am sorry, Frodo."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign03a_11
"I was delayed."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign03b_01
"Frodo!"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign03b_02
"- Frodo! - Sam!"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign03b_03
"Bless you, you're awake!"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign03b_04
"Sam has hardly left your side."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign03b_05
"We were that worried about you, weren't we, Mr. Gandalf?"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign03b_06
"By the skills of Lord Elrond, you're beginning to mend."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign03b_07
"Welcome to Rivendell, Frodo Baggins."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign03c_01
"Strangers from distant lands, friends of old."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign03c_02
"You've been summoned here to answer the threat of Mordor."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign03c_03
"Middle-earth stands upon the brink of destruction."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign03c_04
"None can escape it."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign03c_05
"You will unite or you will fall."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign03c_06
"The Ring was made in the fires of Mount Doom."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign03c_07
"Only there can it be unmade."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign03c_08
"It must be taken deep into Mordor"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign03c_09
"and cast back into the fiery chasm from whence it came."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign03c_10
"One of you must do this."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign05_01
"Let me risk a little more light."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign05_02
"Behold!"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign05_03
"The great realm and Dwarf-city of Dwarrowdelf."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign05_04
"There's an eye-opener, and no mistake."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign06_01
"You shall not pass!"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign06_02
"No! No! Gandalf!"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign06_03
"Fly, you fools!"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign06_04
"No!"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign06_05
"Aragorn!"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign10_01
"Frodo... the Argonath."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign10_02
"Long have I desired to look upon the kings of old."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaign10_03
"My kin."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignCredits_01
"Mordor. I hope the others find a safer route."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignCredits_02
"Strider will look after them."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignCredits_03
"I don't suppose we'll ever see them again."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignCredits_04
"We may yet, Mr. Frodo. We may."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignCredits_05
"Sam..."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignCredits_06
"I'm glad you're with me."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT00_01
"The power of the Enemy is growing."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT00_02
"Sauron will use his puppet, Saruman, to destroy the people of Rohan."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT00_03
"Isengard has been unleashed."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT00_04
"The Eye of Sauron now turns to Gondor,"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT00_05
"the last free kingdom of Men."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT00_06
"His war on this country will come swiftly."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT00_07
"He senses the Ring is close."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT00_08
"The strength of the Ring-bearer is failing."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT00_09
"In his heart, Frodo begins to understand."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT00_10
"The quest will claim his life."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT00_11
"You know this."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT00_12
"You have foreseen it."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT00_13
"It is the risk we all took."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT00_14
"In the gathering dark, the will of the Ring grows strong."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT00_15
"It is close now, so close to achieving its goal."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT00_16
"For Sauron will have dominion over all life on this earth,"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT00_17
"even unto the ending of the world."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT00_18
"The time of the Elves is over."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT00_19
"Do we leave Middle-earth to its fate?"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT00_20
"Do we let them stand alone?"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT01_01
"Mordor will pay for this."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT01_02
"These Orcs are not from Mordor."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT01_03
"My lord Éomer! Over here!"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT01_04
"He was ambushed by Orcs."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT01_05
"If we don't defend our country, Saruman will take it by force."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT01_06
"Orcs are roaming freely across our lands."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT01_07
"Orcs bearing the White Hand of Saruman."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT01_08
"That is a lie."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT01_09
"Saruman the White has ever been our friend and ally."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT01_10
"How long is it since Saruman bought you?"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT01_11
"What was the promised price, Gríma?"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT01_12
"When all the men are dead, you will take your share of the treasure?"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT01_13
"You see much, Éomer, son of Éomund."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT01_14
"Too much."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT01_15
"You are banished forthwith from the kingdom of Rohan and all its domains,"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT01_16
"under pain of death."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT01_17
"You have no authority here!"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT01_18
"Your orders mean nothing!"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT01_19
"This order does not come from me."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT01_20
"It comes from the king."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT01_21
"He signed it this morning."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT02b_01
"The Black Gate of Mordor."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT02b_02
"Save us."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT02b_03
"- I do not ask you to come with me, Sam. - I know, Mr. Frodo."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT02b_04
"I doubt even these Elvish cloaks will hide us in there."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT02b_05
"No! No! No!"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT02b_06
"No, master!"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT02b_07
"They'll catch you! They'll catch you!"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT02b_08
"No! Don't take it to him!"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT02b_09
"There's another way. More secret. A dark way."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT02b_10
"Why haven't you spoken of this before?"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT02b_11
"Because master did not ask."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT02b_12
"He's up to something."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT02b_13
"Are you saying there's another way into Mordor?"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT02b_14
"Yes. There's a path, and stairs,"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT02b_15
"and then... a tunnel."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT02b_16
"Lead the way, Sméagol."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT04_01
"From the lowest dungeon to the highest peak,"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT04_02
"I fought with the Balrog of Morgoth."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT04b_01
"Until at last I threw down my enemy and smote his ruin upon the mountainside."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT04b_02
"Darkness took me."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT04b_03
"And I strayed out of thought and time."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT04b_04
"The stars wheeled overhead,"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT04b_05
"and every day was as long as a life-age of the earth."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT04b_06
"But it was not the end."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT04b_07
"I felt life in me again."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT04b_08
"I've been sent back until my task is done."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT04b_09
"Gandalf."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT04b_10
"I am Gandalf the White."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT04b_11
"And I come back to you now, at the turn of the tide."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT05b_01
"So, this is the answer to all the riddles."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT05b_02
"Here in the wild I have you:"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT05b_03
"two halflings and a host of men at my call."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT05b_04
"The Ring of Power within my grasp."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT05b_05
"A chance for Faramir, Captain of Gondor,"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT05b_06
"to show his quality."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT05b_07
"No!"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT05b_08
"Don't you understand?"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT05b_09
"He's got to destroy it!"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT05b_10
"Osgiliath is under attack."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT05b_11
"They call for reinforcements."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT05b_12
"Please."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT05b_13
"It's such a burden."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT05b_14
"Will you not help him?"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT05b_15
"Captain."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT05b_16
"Prepare to leave."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT06b_01
"I cannot allow you before Théoden King so armed, Gandalf Greyhame."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT06b_02
"By order of Gríma Wormtongue."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT06b_03
"Your staff."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT06b_04
"You would not part an old man from his walking stick?"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT06b_05
"He's a herald of woe."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT06b_06
"The courtesy of your hall is somewhat lessened of late, Théoden King."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT06b_07
"He's not welcome."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT06b_08
"Why should I welcome you,"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT06b_09
"Gandalf Stormcrow?"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT06b_10
"A just question, my liege."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT06b_11
"I will draw you, Saruman, as poison is drawn from a wound."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT06b_12
"If I go, Théoden dies."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT06b_13
"You did not kill me, you will not kill him!"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT06b_14
"Rohan is mine!"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT06b_15
"Be gone!"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT08_01
"Look."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT08_02
"Osgiliath burns."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT08_03
"Mordor has come."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT08_04
"Hurry!"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT09_01
"Helm's Deep! There it is! Helm's Deep!"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT09_02
"Everyone, this way!"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT09b_01
"Final count: forty-two."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT09b_02
"Forty-two?"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT09b_03
"Oh, that's not bad for a pointy-eared Elvish princeling."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT09b_04
"I myself am sitting pretty on forty-three."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT09b_05
"Forty-three."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT09b_06
"He was already dead."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT09b_07
"He was twitching."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT09b_08
"He was twitching because he's got my axe embedded in his nervous system!"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT09b_09
"A family of field mice that climb up sometimes, and they tickle me awfully."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT09b_10
"Always trying to get something with it."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT09b_11
"Many of these trees were my friends."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT09b_12
"Creatures I had known from nut and acorn."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT09b_13
"I'm sorry, Treebeard."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT09b_14
"They had voices of their own."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT09b_15
"Saruman!"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT09b_16
"A wizard should know better!"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT09b_17
"There is no curse in Elvish, Entish, or the tongues of Men"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT09b_18
"for this treachery."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT09b_19
"Come, my friends."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT09b_20
"The Ents are going to war."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT09b_21
"It is likely that we go to our doom."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT09b_22
"The last march of the Ents."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT10b_01
"Break the dam!"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT10b_02
"Release the river!"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT10b_03
"Sauron's wrath will be terrible, his retribution swift."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT10b_04
"The battle for Helm's Deep is over."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT10b_05
"The battle for Middle-earth is about to begin."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT10b_06
"All our hopes now lie with two little Hobbits"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT10b_07
"somewhere in the wilderness."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT10b_08
"Come on, Hobbitses!"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT10b_09
"Long ways to go yet."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT10b_10
"Sméagol will show you the way."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignTTT10b_11
"Follow me!"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK01a_01
"As Saruman's evil is washed away, we send a clear message to Mordor."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK01a_02
"Men are not so weak yet that they are powerless to resist the Dark Lord's will entirely."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK01a_03
"The ruin of Isengard will prove to be a setback,"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK01a_04
"but we would be fools to believe it a deterrent."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK01a_05
"Sauron's power grows by the day."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK01a_06
"Soon he will be ready to strike."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK01a_07
"Our only advantage now lies in his hubris."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK01a_08
"We must force his hand"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK01a_09
"and make him believe that we will use the Ring against him."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK01a_10
"Tonight we remember those who gave their blood to defend this country."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK01a_11
"Hail the victorious dead!"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK01a_12
"Hail!"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK01a_13
"No news of Frodo?"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK01a_14
"No word. Nothing."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK01a_15
"What does your heart tell you?"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK01a_16
"That Frodo is alive."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK01a_17
"Yes."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK01a_18
"Yes, he's alive."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK01a_19
"What are you doing?"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK01a_20
"Pippin, are you mad?"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK01a_21
"I just want to look at it. Just one more time."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK01a_22
"Put it back."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK01a_23
"Pippin!"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK01a_24
"I see you."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK01b_01
"Help! Gandalf!"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK01b_02
"Help! Help me!"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK01b_03
"Look at me."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK01b_04
"Forgive me."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK01b_05
"What did you see?"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK01b_06
"A tree."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK01b_07
"There was a white tree in a courtyard of stone."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK01b_08
"It was dead."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK01b_09
"The city was burning."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK01b_10
"Minas Tirith?"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK01b_11
"Is that what you saw?"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK01b_12
"I saw..."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK01b_13
"I saw him."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK02a_01
"A fool, but an honest fool he remains."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK02a_02
"We've been strangely fortunate."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK02a_03
"Pippin saw in the palantír a glimpse of the Enemy's plan."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK02a_04
"Sauron moves to strike the city of Minas Tirith."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK02a_05
"- I will go. - No."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK02a_06
"- They must be warned. - They will be."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK02a_07
"You must come to Minas Tirith by another road."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK02a_08
"Follow the river. Look to the black ships."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK02a_09
"Understand this."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK02a_10
"Things are now in motion that cannot be undone."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK02a_11
"I ride for Minas Tirith."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK02a_12
"And I won't be going alone."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK02a_13
"How far is Minas Tirith?"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK02a_14
"Three days' ride, as the Nazgûl flies."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK02a_15
"And you'd better hope we don't have one of those on our tail."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK02a_16
"Here. Something for the road."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK02a_17
"The last of the Longbottom Leaf."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK02a_18
"I know you've run out."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK02a_19
"You smoke too much, Pip."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK02a_20
"But we'll see each other soon."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK02a_21
"- Won't we? - I don't know."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK02a_22
"I don't know what's going to happen."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK02a_23
"- Merry? - Run, Shadowfax."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK02a_24
"- Show us the meaning of haste. - Merry!"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK02a_25
"We've just passed into the realm of Gondor."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK02a_26
"Minas Tirith. City of Kings."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK02b_01
"The beacon! The beacon of Amon Dîn is lit!"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK02b_02
"Hope is kindled."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK03a_01
"Grimbold, how many?"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK03a_02
"Five hundred men from the Westfold, my lord."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK03a_03
"Three hundred more from Fenmarch, King Théoden."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK03a_04
"And the riders from Snowbourn?"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK03a_05
"None have come, my lord."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK03a_06
"Six thousand spears."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK03a_07
"Less than half of what I'd hoped for."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK03a_08
"Six thousand will not be enough to break the lines of Mordor."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK03a_09
"More will come."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK03a_10
"Every hour lost hastens Gondor's defeat."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK03a_11
"We have till dawn. Then we must ride."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK05a_01
"The Age of Men is over."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK05a_02
"The time of the Orc has come."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK05a_03
"Send forth all legions."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK05a_04
"Do not stop the attack until the city is taken."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK05a_05
"Slay them all."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK05a_06
"What of the wizard?"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK05a_07
"I will break him."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK05a_08
"Where are Théoden's riders?"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK05a_09
"Will Rohan's army come?"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK05a_10
"Mithrandir?"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK05b_01
"The city is breached!"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK05b_02
"Fall back! To the second level!"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK05b_03
"Get the women and children out!"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK05b_04
"Get them out! Retreat!"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK05b_05
"Come on!"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK05b_06
"Move into the city!"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK05b_07
"Kill all in your path!"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK06a_01
"What is this place?"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK06a_02
"Master must go in the tunnel."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK06a_03
"No. Now that I'm here, I don't think I want to."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK06a_04
"It's the only way."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK06a_05
"Go in..."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK06a_06
"...or go back."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK06a_07
"I can't go back."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK06a_08
"What's that smell?"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK06a_09
"Orcses' filth. Orcses come here sometimes."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK06a_10
"This way!"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK06a_11
"Sméagol!"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK06b_01
"We did it, Mr. Frodo."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK06b_02
"We made it to Mordor."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK06b_03
"There's so many of them."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK06b_04
"We'll never get through unseen."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK06b_05
"It's him. The Eye."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK06b_06
"We have to go in there, Mr. Frodo."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK06b_07
"There's nothing for it."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK06b_08
"Come on."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK06b_09
"Let's just make it down the hill for starters."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK07b_01
"Stop this madness!"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK07b_02
"You will not take my son from me!"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK07b_03
"No! No!"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK07b_04
"No!"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK08a_01
"Courage, Merry. Courage for our friends."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK08a_02
"Form ranks, you maggots! Form ranks!"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK08a_03
"Pikes in front! Archers behind!"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK08a_04
"Éomer, take your éored down the left flank."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK08a_05
"Gamling, follow the King's banner down the centre."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK08a_06
"Grimbold, take your company right, after you pass the wall."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK08a_07
"Forth, and fear no darkness!"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK08a_08
"Arise! Arise, Riders of Théoden!"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK08a_09
"Spears shall be shaken!"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK08a_10
"Shields shall be splintered!"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK08a_11
"A sword-day..."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK08a_12
"...a red day..."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK08a_13
"...ere the sun rises!"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK11a_01
"Frodo, get down!"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK11a_02
"Hide!"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK11b_01
"Give me your hand!"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK11b_02
"Don't let go."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK11b_03
"Reach!"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK14a_01
"Mr. Frodo?"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK14a_02
"What is it?"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK14a_03
"It's four years to the day since Weathertop, Sam."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK14a_04
"It's never really healed."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK14a_05
"There and Back Again."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK14a_06
"A Hobbit's Tale by Bilbo Baggins."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK14a_07
"And The Lord of the Rings by Frodo Baggins."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK14a_08
"You finished it."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK14a_09
"Not quite."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK14a_10
"There's room for a little more."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK14b_01
"I think I'm quite ready for another adventure."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK14b_02
"Farewell, my brave Hobbits."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK14b_03
"My work is now finished."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK14b_04
"Here at last, on the shores of the sea,"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK14b_05
"comes the end of our Fellowship."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK14b_06
"I will not say: do not weep,"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK14b_07
"for not all tears are an evil."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK14b_08
"It is time, Frodo."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK14b_09
"What does he mean?"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK14b_10
"We set out to save the Shire, Sam."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK14b_11
"And it has been saved,"
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK14b_12
"but not for me."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK14b_13
"You don't mean that."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK14b_14
"You can't leave."
END

SUBTITLE:ENAOTRCampaignROTK14b_15
"The last pages are for you, Sam."
END
